00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,315
MyCampusView Academy.

2
00:00:03,365 --> 00:00:06,343
Junior Makers, video 3.

3
00:00:06,393 --> 00:00:07,660
Stay safe.

4
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:12,900
School kits use low voltage, but good habits still matter.

5
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:17,474
Never put kit wires in wall sockets.

6
00:00:17,524 --> 00:00:20,293
Keep drinks away from circuits.

7
00:00:20,343 --> 00:00:24,477
Ask an adult before connecting to mains power.

8
00:00:24,527 --> 00:00:28,660
Stop and check if something smells hot or odd.

9
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:35,872
If a battery pack feels very hot, disconnect power and tell an adult.

10
00:00:35,922 --> 00:00:38,170
Do not add another battery.

11
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:40,987
Let us recap.

12
00:00:41,037 --> 00:00:44,379
Low-voltage kits still need care.

13
00:00:44,429 --> 00:00:48,492
Stop and ask when something seems wrong.

14
00:00:48,542 --> 00:00:52,090
Next: LEDs: light with a direction.
